  Each stage: encode, decode, 3.4 kHz reconstruction; the next card filters 300-3400 Hz
  and is trimmed back to nominal level.  segSNR dB, two scorers:
    total  against the source: codec noise plus the droop of the cascaded filters
    codec  against the source through the same filters with no codec in the chain

