FABRIC -- the highway cell by cell: 8 slots x 64 kHz = 512 kbps a block, up to 8 blocks.
  2048 frames a run, random data on every fitted port.

  1. Every source slot to every listening slot: 64 maps, port p listens to p+m (mod 64).
     4096 (source, listener) pairs, C and A: 0 bit errors at a delay of exactly 1 frame.

  2. Growth: random maps with 1 to 8 blocks fitted; an absent block or an empty slot is FILL / A=0.
