     C_RX is FILL (1010): True;  A_RX is 0: True;  decoded level -48.3 dB re nominal speech

  5. Octets: a source sends bytes b0-first on TX_OCT; the listener frames on RX_OCT = TX_OCT + 1 frame.
     port 52 <- 31: 255 octets, 0 wrong
