CALLS -- one exchange, one 1 kHz tick at a time.  Ports are dialled in octal, 00-77.
  00 idle (never fitted), 01 dial tone, 02 cannot-complete tone, 03-05 registers; subscribers 20-77.
  Release: M or E low for 256 ms (each port's two detectors +-20%), after 16 ms high.  Scanner: 8 ports a tick.

